Gegenprobe: Die FOREGROUND_SERVICE-Erlaubnis von WorkManager bleibt im zusammengeführten Manifest
Modul: app
Test: ch.brickinventoryapp.app.LibraryComponentsTest
Rot: the app asks for no foreground service

diff --git a/Android-App/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml b/Android-App/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
--- a/Android-App/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/Android-App/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -42,9 +42,6 @@
       (services/service/CsvImportWorker.kt, PdfExportWorker.kt). WorkManager brings this
       permission for setForeground(); the app never calls it, so it goes.
     -->
-    <uses-permission
-        android:name="android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"
-        tools:node="remove" />
     <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS" />
     <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.WAKE_LOCK" />
 
